/target
tmp/
*.json
# The signed update manifests are the one JSON the repo must track: GitHub
# Pages serves them from here and the app reads them. Without this negation
# the blanket rule above silently drops latest.json while still committing
# latest.json.sig — a signature with nothing to verify, which is exactly what
# v0.6.1 published.
!updates/**/*.json
/.agents
CLAUDE.md
